{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23755","headline":"昨以拙诗十首寄西川杜相公相公亦以新作十首惠然报示首数虽等工拙不伦重以一章用伸答谢 · 白居易","name":"昨以拙诗十首寄西川杜相公相公亦以新作十首惠然报示首数虽等工拙不伦重以一章用伸答谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗家律手在成都，权与寻常将相殊。\n剪截五言兼用钺，陶钧六义别开炉。\n惊人卷轴须知有，随事文章不道无。\n篇数虽同光价异，十鱼目换十骊珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}